<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-023" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-shanjian" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-shanjian">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-shanjian:subject" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-shanjian:subject:m0000" ref="82k_3oi_qf8">山季倫</persName>為荊州，時出酣暢。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-shanjian:song" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-shanjian:song:m0000" ref="82k_3oi_qf8">山公</persName>時一醉，徑造高陽池。日莫倒載歸，茗艼無所知。復能乘駿馬，倒箸白接籬。舉手問<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-shanjian:song:m0039" ref="rrk_b0p_m6m">葛彊</persName>，何如并州兒？</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-shanjian:gloss" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">高陽池在襄陽。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-shanjian:gloss:m0007" ref="rrk_b0p_m6m">彊</persName>是其愛將，并州人也。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-shanjian:xiangyangji" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-shanjian:xiangyangji:m0000" ref="82k_3oi_qf8">山簡</persName>每臨此池，未嘗不大醉而還，曰：『此是我高陽池也！』襄陽小兒歌之。</p>
</text>
